on mouseUp me
  [  0] pushint8 11 ............................. <11>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <11>
  [  5] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(11)>
  [  7] pushcons 0 .............................. <"shell_down_glow">
  [  9] pusharglist 1 ........................... <"shell_down_glow">
  [ 11] extcall 16 .............................. <cast("shell_down_glow")>
  [ 13] setobjprop 17 ........................... sprite(11).member = cast("shell_down_glow")
  [ 15] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 16] pushint8 26 ............................. <26>
  [ 19] set 7 ................................... set the soundLevel to 0
  [ 21] ret
end

on mouseLeave me
  [  0] pushint8 11 ............................. <11>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <11>
  [  5] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(11)>
  [  7] pushcons 8 .............................. <"shell">
  [  9] pusharglist 1 ........................... <"shell">
  [ 11] extcall 16 .............................. <cast("shell")>
  [ 13] setobjprop 17 ........................... sprite(11).member = cast("shell")
  [ 15] ret
end
